---
title: Crêpes
portions: 4
category: Breakfast
source: "French classic"
---

## Batter ->&batter

[Mix] In a #blender{}, blend the @flour{125 g}, the @milk{250 ml}, the @egg{2}, the @sugar{1 tbsp} and the @salt{1 pinch} until smooth. ->&crepe batter{}

[Rest] Let the &crepe batter{} rest for ~{30 min}.

## Cooking

[Cook] Heat a #crepe pan{} at ^{medium heat}, butter lightly, and pour a thin ladle of &crepe batter{}.

[Flip] Cook ~{1 min}, flip, and cook ~{30 s} more.

[Butter] Melt the @butter{30 g} and brush the pan between crêpes.
